{"video": "chocolate", "titulo": "Como surgiu o chocolate?", "fps": 30, "durationInFrames": 1800, "durationSeconds": 60.0, "engine": "kokoro", "voz": {"estilo": "documentario", "ritmo": 1.0}, "scenes": [{"id": "gancho", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 0, "endFrame": 102, "lines": [{"text": "Sabia que o chocolate já foi dinheiro?", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 81, "words": [{"text": "Sabia", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 17}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 17, "endFrame": 22}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 22, "endFrame": 27}, {"text": "chocolate", "startFrame": 27, "endFrame": 45}, {"text": "já", "startFrame": 45, "endFrame": 53}, {"text": "foi", "startFrame": 53, "endFrame": 61}, {"text": "dinheiro?", "startFrame": 61, "endFrame": 81}]}]}, {"id": "origem", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 102, "endFrame": 415, "lines": [{"text": "Mais de três mil anos atrás, povos do México e da América Central já usavam o cacau.", "startFrame": 123, "endFrame": 293, "words": [{"text": "Mais", "startFrame": 123, "endFrame": 133}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 133, "endFrame": 140}, {"text": "três", "startFrame": 140, "endFrame": 152}, {"text": "mil", "startFrame": 152, "endFrame": 160}, {"text": "anos", "startFrame": 160, "endFrame": 173}, {"text": "atrás,", "startFrame": 173, "endFrame": 187}, {"text": "povos", "startFrame": 195, "endFrame": 205}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 205, "endFrame": 207}, {"text": "México", "startFrame": 207, "endFrame": 220}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 220, "endFrame": 222}, {"text": "da", "startFrame": 222, "endFrame": 226}, {"text": "América", "startFrame": 226, "endFrame": 240}, {"text": "Central", "startFrame": 240, "endFrame": 259}, {"text": "já", "startFrame": 259, "endFrame": 262}, {"text": "usavam", "startFrame": 262, "endFrame": 277}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 277, "endFrame": 282}, {"text": "cacau.", "startFrame": 282, "endFrame": 293}]}, {"text": "Ele nasce numa fruta assim, cheia de sementes.", "startFrame": 305, "endFrame": 394, "words": [{"text": "Ele", "startFrame": 305, "endFrame": 311}, {"text": "nasce", "startFrame": 311, "endFrame": 322}, {"text": "numa", "startFrame": 322, "endFrame": 331}, {"text": "fruta", "startFrame": 331, "endFrame": 342}, {"text": "assim,", "startFrame": 342, "endFrame": 352}, {"text": "cheia", "startFrame": 352, "endFrame": 364}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 364, "endFrame": 370}, {"text": "sementes.", "startFrame": 370, "endFrame": 394}]}]}, {"id": "maias", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 415, "endFrame": 643, "lines": [{"text": "Os maias faziam uma bebida amarga e espumante… às vezes com pimenta!", "startFrame": 437, "endFrame": 568, "words": [{"text": "Os", "startFrame": 437, "endFrame": 439}, {"text": "maias", "startFrame": 439, "endFrame": 448}, {"text": "faziam", "startFrame": 448, "endFrame": 459}, {"text": "uma", "startFrame": 459, "endFrame": 462}, {"text": "bebida", "startFrame": 462, "endFrame": 472}, {"text": "amarga", "startFrame": 472, "endFrame": 482}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 482, "endFrame": 485}, {"text": "espumante…", "startFrame": 485, "endFrame": 497}, {"text": "às", "startFrame": 501, "endFrame": 509}, {"text": "vezes", "startFrame": 509, "endFrame": 529}, {"text": "com", "startFrame": 529, "endFrame": 538}, {"text": "pimenta!", "startFrame": 538, "endFrame": 568}]}, {"text": "Nada de docinho!", "startFrame": 579, "endFrame": 622, "words": [{"text": "Nada", "startFrame": 579, "endFrame": 591}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 591, "endFrame": 601}, {"text": "docinho!", "startFrame": 601, "endFrame": 622}]}]}, {"id": "dinheiro", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 643, "endFrame": 912, "lines": [{"text": "Já os astecas usavam as sementes de cacau como moeda!", "startFrame": 664, "endFrame": 774, "words": [{"text": "Já", "startFrame": 664, "endFrame": 670}, {"text": "os", "startFrame": 670, "endFrame": 673}, {"text": "astecas", "startFrame": 673, "endFrame": 687}, {"text": "usavam", "startFrame": 687, "endFrame": 706}, {"text": "as", "startFrame": 706, "endFrame": 711}, {"text": "sementes", "startFrame": 711, "endFrame": 735}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 735, "endFrame": 741}, {"text": "cacau", "startFrame": 741, "endFrame": 750}, {"text": "como", "startFrame": 750, "endFrame": 763}, {"text": "moeda!", "startFrame": 763, "endFrame": 774}]}, {"text": "Imagina pagar o pão… e receber o troco em sementinhas!", "startFrame": 785, "endFrame": 891, "words": [{"text": "Imagina", "startFrame": 785, "endFrame": 795}, {"text": "pagar", "startFrame": 795, "endFrame": 803}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 803, "endFrame": 807}, {"text": "pão…", "startFrame": 807, "endFrame": 814}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 817, "endFrame": 822}, {"text": "receber", "startFrame": 822, "endFrame": 839}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 839, "endFrame": 842}, {"text": "troco", "startFrame": 842, "endFrame": 853}, {"text": "em", "startFrame": 853, "endFrame": 860}, {"text": "sementinhas!", "startFrame": 860, "endFrame": 891}]}]}, {"id": "europa", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 912, "endFrame": 1075, "lines": [{"text": "No século dezesseis, o cacau chegou à Europa… e lá ganhou açúcar!", "startFrame": 933, "endFrame": 1054, "words": [{"text": "No", "startFrame": 933, "endFrame": 937}, {"text": "século", "startFrame": 937, "endFrame": 950}, {"text": "dezesseis,", "startFrame": 950, "endFrame": 967}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 967, "endFrame": 972}, {"text": "cacau", "startFrame": 972, "endFrame": 985}, {"text": "chegou", "startFrame": 985, "endFrame": 992}, {"text": "à", "startFrame": 992, "endFrame": 997}, {"text": "Europa…", "startFrame": 997, "endFrame": 1013}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 1016, "endFrame": 1019}, {"text": "lá", "startFrame": 1019, "endFrame": 1024}, {"text": "ganhou", "startFrame": 1024, "endFrame": 1039}, {"text": "açúcar!", "startFrame": 1039, "endFrame": 1054}]}]}, {"id": "barra", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 1075, "endFrame": 1491, "lines": [{"text": "Em 1847, uma fábrica inglesa criou uma das primeiras barras de chocolate pra comer.", "startFra